        <mxCell id="oy-G2h6dQSmSWpdXyF6X-7" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list:Ignore&quot;&gt;1)&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Считывается количество соседей &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; для клетки с координатой &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; и &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list:Ignore&quot;&gt;2)&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Если клетка мертва (то есть значение &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;curState&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;EN-US&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;] == 0) и n &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Cambria Math&amp;quot;,serif;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Cambria Math&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt; B, то клетка становится живой.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list:Ignore&quot;&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Если клетка жива (&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;EN-US&quot;&gt;curState&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language:EN-US&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;] == 1) и n &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Cambria Math&amp;quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Cambria Math&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;∈&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;S, то клетка остаётся живой. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpLast&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-list:Ignore&quot;&gt;4)&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Иначе клетка становится мёртвой.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="119" width="550" x="1024" y="1708" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
